
### Cadastrar Usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mario Alves",
  "email": "mario@teste.com",
  "password": "123",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN"
}

### Fazer Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mario@teste.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Cadastrar Insumo (Protegido por JWT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

